Subject: Map joysticks, gamepad lists and the HID API
Upstream-base: fbe120f5020f8bdcb9cbf5ae28d9859b29781119

For the host's Wii Remote and WPAD code. On Switch the libnx pads gain their
joystick view and joystick events. HID devices and virtual joysticks fail there
with an error, as nothing on the console can provide them.

